{"2308710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Green Valley County", "steam_appid": 2308710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the colorful world of Green Valley County. Do farm chores, take orders and make money. To fulfill your dream and go to a paradise island, you need to contact a travel agency and complete tasks from an agent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Execute orders:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take orders to make money on fulfilling your dreams. At the beginning, you will have nothing but a pack of seeds and a small amount of money, you will have to wisely spend this money, buy the essentials and start fulfilling the first orders. Use your home kitchen to fulfill your first orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn your first large amount and improve your production to fulfill larger orders. The more your production, the more money you will earn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308710/extras/15e42af7c4b6abbcfec598eb46f54552.poster.avif?t=1776339204\" width=390 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308710/extras/15e42af7c4b6abbcfec598eb46f54552.webm?t=1776339204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308710/extras/15e42af7c4b6abbcfec598eb46f54552.mp4?t=1776339204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop the farm:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orders require a lot of resources, improve your farm, so you will have more animals and raw materials that you need in the production of farm products. Feed and drink animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308710/extras/218a3c7c9ab18c6804e4c5dc91974649.poster.avif?t=1776339204\" width=390 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308710/extras/218a3c7c9ab18c6804e4c5dc91974649.webm?t=1776339204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308710/extras/218a3c7c9ab18c6804e4c5dc91974649.mp4?t=1776339204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop a vegetable garden:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy seeds at the nearest store or buy a car and go to the city to a major seller. Improve your vegetable garden, this will allow you to get more crops and fulfill more orders that will bring you a lot of money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308710/extras/1127ecee383fe9bf298857029fc323a6.poster.avif?t=1776339204\" width=390 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308710/extras/1127ecee383fe9bf298857029fc323a6.webm?t=1776339204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308710/extras/1127ecee383fe9bf298857029fc323a6.mp4?t=1776339204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In production, you will also need sea and river fish. At the entry level, you can fish with a fishing rod, but when your production becomes more, you can no longer do without fishing nets, which automate the process of fishing. Fry the fish on the stove or send it to production to fulfill the order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308710/extras/30939498453f0425fd4a1673244d510e.poster.avif?t=1776339204\" width=390 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308710/extras/30939498453f0425fd4a1673244d510e.webm?t=1776339204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308710/extras/30939498453f0425fd4a1673244d510e.mp4?t=1776339204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character needs:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor the needs of the character, satisfy hunger and thirst, go to the toilet during the time to avoid embarrassment, wash in the bathroom. Watch for the purity of the character otherwise he can get an infection from severe pollution. Avoid the cold, low temperatures will lead to hypothermia and illness. Buy and take medicines to maintain immunity, if you get sick, you can go to the city hospital and get treatment. Improve your home, this will help reduce the needs of the character.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the surrounding area, so you will find useful resources for improving buildings. Or buy them from a merchant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy a car with a trailer from a local merchant, so you will be more comfortable shopping in the city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the road you can find rubble of stones or fallen trees, take tools with you to clear the rubble.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has dynamic weather: rain, fog, storm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't be bored, you can play with another network mode.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the colorful world of Green Valley County. Do farm chores, take orders and make money. To fulfill your dream and go to a paradise island, you need to contact a travel agency and complete tasks from an agent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Execute orders:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take orders to make money on fulfilling your dreams. At the beginning, you will have nothing but a pack of seeds and a small amount of money, you will have to wisely spend this money, buy the essentials and start fulfilling the first orders. Use your home kitchen to fulfill your first orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn your first large amount and improve your production to fulfill larger orders. The more your production, the more money you will earn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308710/extras/15e42af7c4b6abbcfec598eb46f54552.poster.avif?t=1776339204\" width=390 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308710/extras/15e42af7c4b6abbcfec598eb46f54552.webm?t=1776339204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308710/extras/15e42af7c4b6abbcfec598eb46f54552.mp4?t=1776339204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop the farm:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orders require a lot of resources, improve your farm, so you will have more animals and raw materials that you need in the production of farm products. Feed and drink animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308710/extras/218a3c7c9ab18c6804e4c5dc91974649.poster.avif?t=1776339204\" width=390 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308710/extras/218a3c7c9ab18c6804e4c5dc91974649.webm?t=1776339204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308710/extras/218a3c7c9ab18c6804e4c5dc91974649.mp4?t=1776339204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop a vegetable garden:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy seeds at the nearest store or buy a car and go to the city to a major seller. Improve your vegetable garden, this will allow you to get more crops and fulfill more orders that will bring you a lot of money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308710/extras/1127ecee383fe9bf298857029fc323a6.poster.avif?t=1776339204\" width=390 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308710/extras/1127ecee383fe9bf298857029fc323a6.webm?t=1776339204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308710/extras/1127ecee383fe9bf298857029fc323a6.mp4?t=1776339204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In production, you will also need sea and river fish. At the entry level, you can fish with a fishing rod, but when your production becomes more, you can no longer do without fishing nets, which automate the process of fishing. Fry the fish on the stove or send it to production to fulfill the order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308710/extras/30939498453f0425fd4a1673244d510e.poster.avif?t=1776339204\" width=390 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308710/extras/30939498453f0425fd4a1673244d510e.webm?t=1776339204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308710/extras/30939498453f0425fd4a1673244d510e.mp4?t=1776339204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character needs:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor the needs of the character, satisfy hunger and thirst, go to the toilet during the time to avoid embarrassment, wash in the bathroom. Watch for the purity of the character otherwise he can get an infection from severe pollution. Avoid the cold, low temperatures will lead to hypothermia and illness. Buy and take medicines to maintain immunity, if you get sick, you can go to the city hospital and get treatment. Improve your home, this will help reduce the needs of the character.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the surrounding area, so you will find useful resources for improving buildings. Or buy them from a merchant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy a car with a trailer from a local merchant, so you will be more comfortable shopping in the city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the road you can find rubble of stones or fallen trees, take tools with you to clear the rubble.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has dynamic weather: rain, fog, storm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't be bored, you can play with another network mode.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Green Valley County is an open-world farming game played from a first-person perspective. Both single-player and co-op modes are available.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308710/9b3149a42d1dc17d2402a0525efa1d69a6f787c2/header.jpg?t=1776339204", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app